WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.112
Section 6.

00:00:02.062 --> 00:00:04.175
CRTC.

00:00:04.175 --> 00:00:06.400
The Captured Regulator.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:11.237
The CRTC has become a retirement home for telecom executives.

00:00:11.237 --> 00:00:18.425
They have approved every step of media consolidation and serve the interests of the entities they were created to oversee.
